    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch implementation of the selective state-space recurrence
  (Mamba's S6), with the scan checked three independent ways — a reference
  loop, a chunked kernel-style path, and an associative Hillis-Steele scan —
  asserted equal to float64 tolerance and mutation-tested, alongside an honest
  parameter-matched comparison against a Transformer on multi-query associative
  recall, including the control that overturns the headline result.
keywords:
